name markdown
category Package
revision 79410
shortdesc Converting and rendering markdown documents inside TeX
longdesc The package provides facilities for the conversion of markdown
longdesc and YAML markup to plain TeX. These are provided both in form
longdesc of a Lua module and in form of plain TeX, LaTeX, and ConTeXt
longdesc macro packages that enable the direct inclusion of markdown and
longdesc YAML documents inside TeX documents.
depend l3kernel
depend lt3luabridge
depend lua-tinyyaml
depend markdown.ARCH
